Identify the modified build

Changes only what dbt displays: --version, --help, the run banner and `dbt debug`. A separate
variable carries the text because DBT_VERSION also sets the Jinja dbt_version, which packages
compare as a version. `distribution` stays dbt-oss, because it classifies the install rather than
naming it.

